## What was dead
shared/landData/countySourceCensus.ts builds COUNTY_SOURCE_CENSUS from countySourceCensus.tn.json at module load
([tnCensus].map(...) — not provably pure, so never tree-shaken). The only client consumer,
client/src/components/maps/LandCoveragePanel.tsx, imported COVERAGE_LABELS + two types from it, and renders the
census it gets from GET /api/land-data/coverage — so the whole 95-county JSON shipped in the maps chunk and was never read.

